# Dockerfile Standards

## Required

```dockerfile
FROM python:3.12-slim@sha256:<digest>  # always digest-pin
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y tmux asciinema && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
WORKDIR /app
```

- Every `FROM` must include `@sha256:<digest>` (tag-only is blocked)
- Final stage: canonical Terminal-Bench base image when language matches
- Non-canonical base: add brief justification comment in Dockerfile
- Pin all package versions (pip, npm, apt where possible)
- Set WORKDIR before tests run

## Forbidden

- `COPY solution/` or `COPY tests/`
- Baking oracle answers into the image
- Privileged mode
- environment/ > 100 MiB total or any file > 50 MiB

## Validate

Run `./scripts/terminus validate <task-dir>` after Dockerfile edits.
